<p>UTHO AY SAKINA S.A.... SUNSAAN HAIN ZINDAA'N.</p>

<p>JEE PAAYEGI KAISE..... TANHA YEH TERI MAA.</p>

<p>1. WEHSHAT HAI BARASTI HAR SOO HAIN ANDHERA**2.</p>

<p>IS QAID MEIN KAISE.....SO PAAYEGI NAADA'N.</p>

<p>2. EK BAAR MUJHE PHIR MAA KEHKE PUKAARO..*2</p>

<p>IS TARHA NA MUJHKO..... TADPAO MERI JAA'N.</p>

<p>3. AB HUMKO MILI HAIN ZINDAA'N SE RIHAAYI..*2</p>

<p>JAANE KA WATAN KO..... KAB SE THA YEH ARMAA'N.</p>

<p>4. YUN CHOD KE MUJH KO JAATI HO JO BIBI..*2</p>

<p>MADAR KA TUMHARI...... HAIN MAUT KA SAAMA'N.</p>

<p>5. KARBAL SE LAHAD TAK RUQSAAR HAIN SOOJHE..*2</p>

<p>JO ZULM KIYE TUM PAR..... THE KAISE MUSALMAA'N.</p>

<p>6. AANKHO'N MEIN WO MANZAR MEHFOOZ HAIN BIBI..*2</p>

<p>TAR QOO'N SE THA TERA... MASOOM SA DAAMA'N.</p>

<p>7. RULWAATE HAI BIBI AB TAK BHI TERA GHUM..*2</p>

<p>UTH-TA HAI HAR EK AANKH SE..... AB ASHKON KA TOOFAA'N.</p>

<p>8. MEHSHAR THA SOHAIL EK ZINDAAN E SITAM MEIN..*2</p>

<p>YEH ROKE FIGHAA'N KARTI THI.... JAB KOOK JALI MAA.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RAZA ALI SOHAIL SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
</p>